* Numeric Constants

Numeric constants are high-precision ⟪GTI18N_0d502d48_000001⟫values⟪GTI18N_0d502d48_000002⟫.

An untyped constant takes the type needed by its context.

Try printing ⟪GTI18N_0d502d48_000003⟫needInt(Big)⟪GTI18N_0d502d48_000004⟫ too.

(An ⟪GTI18N_0d502d48_000005⟫int⟪GTI18N_0d502d48_000006⟫ can store at maximum a 64-bit integer, and sometimes less.)

